{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/24/5593292/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/24/5593292/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"現在発売中の、UTBさんの\nオフショットです( *´ヮ`* )"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/24/5593292/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/24/5593292/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイドルらしいポーズや表情は\n一切なく、自然体な中での\n写真を撮って頂きました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/24/5593292/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/24/5593292/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/24/5593292/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カメラマンさんは、松井玲奈さんの\nファースト写真集「きんぎょ｣を\n撮った 丸谷嘉長さん。\nとっても勉強になりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/24/5593292/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"表現者としての私。素の私。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"UTBさん、ぜひ見てください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/24/5593292/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/24/5593292/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わ〜♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/24/5593292/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台「じょしらく｣で演出を\nしてくださった川尻さん、\n音楽を担当してくださった\nあらいさんが手掛けた舞台、\n「青春鉄道｣を観てきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とってもとっても面白かったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなに人を笑顔にさせる\nものづくりが出来るってすごいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しばらく笑いの余韻が残ってます（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"六義園のライトアップを\n見てきました( ﹡ˆoˆ﹡ )"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/24/5593292/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時間が空けばどこへでもフラっと\n一人で出掛けるのが好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"六義園は、都内でも一番好きな\n庭園で、どの季節も素晴らしいので\nもう何度も行っています(﹡ˆˆ﹡)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/24/5593292/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/24/5593292/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもこうやって、紅葉の時期に\nゆっくり夜のライトアップを\n見に行けるのは、初めてでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/24/5593292/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだちょこっと色づき始めでしたが\n十分、綺麗でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/24/5593292/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/24/5593292/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昼間とはまた全然違って、\n幻想的な美しさがありました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"途中のお茶屋さんで、三福だんごの\n醤油を買い、もぐもぐしながら\nゆっくり見て回りました。\nめちゃめちゃ美味しかったです。\n今度はくるみ味噌も食べてみたいな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"季節って当たり前に過ぎていくけど、\n四季があるって、本当に\n素敵だなあって思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おんなじ景色でも、\n見るたびに表情が違うのが\n面白いし、好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これは西洋の庭園では見られない、\n日本だからこそ生み出せる美しさですね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全てが左右対称の西洋もすごく素敵だけど、\n遠近感や奥行感を持たせて\n大自然の中にある美しさを活かし、\n季節や見方によって千変万化する\n日本の庭園も本当に素敵。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、こんな風に『当たり前』に\n毎年訪れる季節の流れを\nちゃんと『大切』にする、\nその思いも好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"紅葉、できればもっと遠くまで\n色んなとこに行って見たいな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/24/5593292/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/24/5593292/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/24/5593292/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆヽ(｡･ω･｡)正義"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/24/5593292/0000.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}